cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "cudaq-pde: gate-level quantum PDE solvers on CUDA-Q"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ramakrishna
    given-names: Kushal
    affiliation: "Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf (HZDR)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gyro555in/cudaq-pde"
abstract: >-
  Gate-level, hardware-portable reference implementations of quantum PDE
  solvers on CUDA-Q: spectral advection with the quantum Fourier transform and
  variational advection-diffusion, validated against exact classical solutions,
  with resource accounting. Not a claim of quantum advantage.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - CUDA-Q
  - partial differential equations
  - quantum Fourier transform
